  "human_checkpoints": [
    "human confirms authority, data boundary, decision owner, and requested scope",
    "human approves research purpose, governed data use, and evidence sufficiency",
    "human selects strategy, priority, and GO/PIVOT/KILL outcome",
    "human approves behavior, scope, acceptance criteria, plan, and unresolved exclusions",
    "human owns taste choices, prototype promotion, accepted findings, and design disposition",
    "human approves architecture, data migration, authorization, autonomy, risk, and rollback boundaries",
    "human authorizes exact workspace, writer, mutation scope, and accepted remediation",
    "human accepts independent findings, risk disposition, and any separate repair authorization",
    "human approves budgets, thresholds, residual risk, and optimization or reliability work",
    "human accepts release scope, redaction, residual risk, and each upcoming remote action separately",
    "human grants fresh per-action authorization for one exact target and immutable input",
    "human selects continue, extend, investigate, or separately authorize rollback",
    "human authorizes mitigation or rollback actions and owns incident closure",
    "human approves improvement commitments, learning persistence, and next-cycle scope"
  ],
